    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Befriend monsters and get to know them<br></li><li>Battle enemies in turn based elemental combat<br></li><li>Choose what monster gets to speak to new recruits<br></li><li>Build monsters relationships with each other and follow their quest-lines<br></li><li>Permanent death and high stakes, monsters react and grieve for fallen allies<br></li><li>Replayable roguelite runs with a continuous story<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer Battling vs other players </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>In the ruins of humanity, intelligent and speaking monsters roam the Nordic landscape. But something is rumbling in the deep: an ancient being has awoken and is preparing to extinguish life in the North. One human and a party of monsters are the only things standing in it's way. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685930/extras/e04ea97877fe9d1392b4c0ace913f51b.poster.avif?t=1747743300\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685930/extras/e04ea97877fe9d1392b4c0ace913f51b.webm?t=1747743300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685930/extras/e04ea97877fe9d1392b4c0ace913f51b.mp4?t=1747743300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game is blind accessible, with Screenreader support and descriptions for monsters and visuals<br></li><li>Super Cane navigation<br></li><li>Contrast Options<br></li><li>Scaleable Text<br></li><li>Rebindable Controls<br></li><li>Difficulty modifiers </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685930/extras/652cf6c3479e34647ba9ce850cb50fb9.poster.avif?t=1747743300\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685930/extras/652cf6c3479e34647ba9ce850cb50fb9.apng?t=1747743300\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
